{
  "changelog": "alibabacloud-dataphin-skills 0.0.1 \u2013 Initial Release\n\n- Introduces an entry suite for Alibaba Cloud Dataphin skills, providing scenario-based routing to specific sub-skills.\n- Supports workflows across data planning, integration, development, operations monitoring, security, asset management, API development, and knowledge graphs.\n- Details strict CLI and credential pre-checks; environment type (public cloud/standalone) is auto-detected without exposing to the user.\n- Centralizes sub-skill structure and dynamic child skill loading by scenario keywords.\n- Outlines environment variables, pre-checks, and authentication flows for seamless operation.\n- Enforces best practices for secure credential handling and user guidance.",
